$ rsbdd -v tests/data/ite_is_true.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
a*, b*, c*;
--- stderr

$ rsbdd -m -t -f true tests/data/ite_is_true.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
| a     | b     | c     | *     |
|-------|-------|-------|-------|
| Any   | Any   | Any   | True  |
